            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1185",
            "canonical_text": "5.7.2 Navigation Icons",
            "semantic_order": 1169,
            "node_type": "heading",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 104.50800323486328,
              "y0": 739.1400146484375,
              "x1": 244.34884643554688,
              "y1": 727.8720092773438
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1186",
            "canonical_text": "There are some buttons that always perform the same function:",
            "semantic_order": 1170,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 103.96902465820312,
              "y0": 717.2758178710938,
              "x1": 373.5378723144531,
              "y1": 707.2400512695312
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1187",
            "canonical_text": "Home. The home icon takes you to the most recently viewed monitoring screen and stores any modification made to data on the screen.",
            "semantic_order": 1171,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 104.17787170410156,
              "y0": 692.9049682617188,
              "x1": 558.5430297851562,
              "y1": 672.5337524414062
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1188",
            "canonical_text": "Return. The return icon takes you to the previous menu screen and stores any modification made to data on",
            "semantic_order": 1172,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 104.16924285888672,
              "y0": 655.5848388671875,
              "x1": 558.663330078125,
              "y1": 645.56005859375
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1189",
            "canonical_text": "the screen.",
            "semantic_order": 1173,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 104.27616882324219,
              "y0": 642.4769287109375,
              "x1": 148.86813354492188,
              "y1": 635.1752319335938
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1190",
            "canonical_text": "Enter. The enter icon stores any modification made to data on the screen and returns to the monitoring screen or brings up the next menu screen.",
            "semantic_order": 1174,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 104.17920684814453,
              "y0": 618.2648315429688,
              "x1": 547.4608764648438,
              "y1": 595.1980590820312
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1191",
            "canonical_text": "Cancel. The cancel icon causes any entries to be discarded.",
            "semantic_order": 1175,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 104.37840270996094,
              "y0": 580.955810546875,
              "x1": 352.91680908203125,
              "y1": 571.0189208984375
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1192",
            "canonical_text": "On some screens, for example Patient Data, there is no cancel button. As soon as a patient's data is entered, it is stored by the system.",
            "semantic_order": 1176,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 103.98052978515625,
              "y0": 561.936279296875,
              "x1": 558.4222412109375,
              "y1": 538.9793090820312
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1193",
            "canonical_text": "List buttons. Some of the screens have buttons that appear to be split in two.",
            "semantic_order": 1177,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 104.16924285888672,
              "y0": 524.6158447265625,
              "x1": 430.87384033203125,
              "y1": 514.580078125
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1194",
            "canonical_text": "In these cases, touching anywhere on the button reveals a list of selectable items. The right side of the button displays the current selection.",
            "semantic_order": 1178,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 104.21111297607422,
              "y0": 465.57635498046875,
              "x1": 558.596435546875,
              "y1": 442.52056884765625
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1195",
            "canonical_text": "Value button. Some screens have square buttons as shown below. Touch the button to display a keypad.",
            "semantic_order": 1179,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 104.05968475341797,
              "y0": 428.25579833984375,
              "x1": 545.7971801757812,
              "y1": 418.2200927734375
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1196",
            "canonical_text": "Toggle button. When an option exists between two choices, such as on/off, a toggle button appears.",
            "semantic_order": 1180,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 104.33856201171875,
              "y0": 377.7821044921875,
              "x1": 528.8096313476562,
              "y1": 367.3181457519531
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1197",
            "canonical_text": "Touch on the opposite side of the button to switch the choice.",
            "semantic_order": 1181,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 103.96949005126953,
              "y0": 323.3761901855469,
              "x1": 369.9359436035156,
              "y1": 313.3404846191406
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/1198",
            "canonical_text": "Keypad. Touch the keys on the keypad to enter numeric data.",
            "semantic_order": 1182,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 88,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 104.19912719726562,
              "y0": 299.06494140625,
              "x1": 369.212158203125,
              "y1": 289.0401916503906
            }
